    <title>念天骄</title>
    <url>/2019/11/02/%E5%BF%B5%E5%A4%A9%E9%AA%84/</url>
    <content><![CDATA[<div style="font-family: 'SimSun', '宋体', serif; text-align: center;">
<p align="center">执雄缨，&emsp;&emsp;&emsp;&emsp;</p>
<p align="center">引长弓。&emsp;&emsp;&emsp;&emsp;</p>
<p align="center">踏破狼烟，&emsp;&emsp;&emsp;</p>
<p align="center">一言九鼎叱诸侯！</p>
</div>
<span id="more"></span>
<br/>
<div style="font-family: 'SimSun', '宋体', serif; text-align: center;">
<p align="center">刃邪冥，&emsp;&emsp;&emsp;&emsp;</p>
<p align="center">射苍穹。&emsp;&emsp;&emsp;&emsp;</p>
<p align="center">披星戴月，&emsp;&emsp;&emsp;</p>
<p align="center">世间独尊号天后。</p>
<br/>
<p align="center">人之命，&emsp;&emsp;&emsp;&emsp;</p>
<p align="center">天无情。&emsp;&emsp;&emsp;&emsp;</p>
<p align="center">骄辉易逝，&emsp;&emsp;&emsp;</p>
<p align="center">儿女情长寿亭侯。</p>
<br/>
<p align="center">醉千秋，&emsp;&emsp;&emsp;&emsp;</p>
<p align="center">梦渐醒。&emsp;&emsp;&emsp;&emsp;</p>
<p align="center">曲终人离，&emsp;&emsp;&emsp;</p>
<p align="center">不见琉年龙山头！</p>
</div>]]></content>
